        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(qa-channel): add timeout to qa-bus state guarded fetch",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where `getQaBusState` called `fetchWithSsrFGuard` with no `timeoutMs` and no `AbortSignal`, so a loopback qa-bus peer that accepted TCP but never returned headers could hang Gateway/QA tooling forever (body idle caps never start).\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Pass `timeoutMs: QA_BUS_STATE_TIMEOUT_MS` (10s) through the existing guarded fetch, matching Feishu registration / similar Type C hang floors.\n- Optional `options.timeoutMs` overrides for hermetic hang regressions only; production callers omit it.\n- No new config/env surface.\n\n## User Impact\n\n**Before:** A hung qa-bus `/v1/state` peer could pin state inspection indefinitely.\n\n**After:** State fetches fail closed after 10s with `TimeoutError` so QA/monitor loops can continue.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHead: `a5b758d58d0e53f0b0e954eb96669ecc7926f1e3`\n\nExecutable negative control + fix proof:\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/qa-channel/src/bus-client.test.ts -- --run -t \"negative control|never returns headers\" --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n```text\nstdout | extensions/qa-channel/src/bus-client.test.ts > qa-bus client > negative control: never-headers peer stays pending without timeoutMs\n[qa-channel bus-state negative control] outcome=still-pending wait_ms=200 without_timeoutMs=true\n[qa-channel bus-state hang proof] timed_out=true name=TimeoutError elapsed_ms=86 production_timeout_ms=10000\n ✓ |extension-qa| extensions/qa-channel/src/bus-client.test.ts > qa-bus client > negative control: never-headers peer stays pending without timeoutMs 253ms\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  2 passed | 6 skipped (8)\n```\n\n- **Negative control (executable):** pre-fix call shape — `fetchWithSsrFGuard` with **no** `timeoutMs` against the same never-headers peer stays `still-pending` after 200ms.\n- **After fix:** `getQaBusState(..., { timeoutMs: 80 })` rejects with `TimeoutError` in ~80ms; production default `QA_BUS_STATE_TIMEOUT_MS = 10_000`.\n- Touched: `extensions/qa-channel/src/bus-client.ts` (+ colocated test). Sibling Feishu registration / other Type C floors unchanged.\n\nAI-assisted.\n",
        "branch": "fix/qa-channel-bus-state-timeout",
